{"id":"ff338b5fa0b80bc1","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-cl-not-terminating.md","title":"CL 的有限归约环","display":"ex-cl-not-terminating — CL 的有限归约环","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-ex-cl-not-terminating","aliases":["56-ex-cl-not-terminating"],"display":"ex-cl-not-terminating — CL 的有限归约环","depends_on":["[[56-df-combinatory-logic]]","[[56-df-terminating]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Example 3.3.3, printed p66","source_ocr_block":"87","verification_status":"source-example-compared; three-steps-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-cl-not-terminating"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-cl-not-terminating</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-cl-not-terminating — CL 的有限归约环"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8d1b6ff7d633b15e\" href=\"?note=8d1b6ff7d633b15e\" title=\"56-df-combinatory-logic\">56-df-combinatory-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0c9e286170288bf\" href=\"?note=a0c9e286170288bf\" title=\"56-df-terminating\">56-df-terminating</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Example 3.3.3, printed p66"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"87"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-example-compared; three-steps-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=SII\">\\(D=SII\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=DD\">\\(M=DD\\)</span>，CL 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8d1b6ff7d633b15e\" href=\"?note=8d1b6ff7d633b15e\" title=\"56-df-combinatory-logic\">56-df-combinatory-logic</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Terminating}(A,\\to)\">\\(\\mathrm{Terminating}(A,\\to)\\)</span> 是沿归约方向无无限链，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0c9e286170288bf\" href=\"?note=a0c9e286170288bf\" title=\"56-df-terminating\">56-df-terminating</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"DD\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}ID(ID)\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}D(ID)\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}DD.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[DD\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}ID(ID)\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}D(ID)\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}DD.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Terminating}(T_{\\mathrm{CL}},\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{Terminating}(T_{\\mathrm{CL}},\\to_{\\mathrm{CL}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Example 3.3.3（印刷 p66，OCR 页块87）。重复此三步环就得到无限归约；自应用本身不意味着一般项都有环，本例给出具体见证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-combinatory-logic","status":"resolved","id":"8d1b6ff7d633b15e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-combinatory-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terminating","status":"resolved","id":"a0c9e286170288bf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terminating]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-combinatory-logic","status":"resolved","id":"8d1b6ff7d633b15e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"令 $D=SII$，$M=DD$，CL 与 $\\to_{